OL,3,GNEWSAFour sites included in free car
OL,4,Aparking trials
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree parking is to be made available at
OL,7,Ffour sites in North East Lincolnshire
OL,8,Fas part of trials.
OL,10,FCar parks at the Town Hall in Grimsby
OL,11,Fand the Civic Offices in Cleethorpes
OL,12,Fwill offer two hours' free parking at
OL,13,Fweekends and on bank holidays, for nine
OL,14,Fmonths from 7 December.
OL,16,FIn Cleethorpes, the Victoria Car Park,
OL,17,Fbehind The Old Vic pub, and the one in
OL,18,FSt Peter's Avenue will offer up to an
OL,19,Fhour of free parking during a separate
OL,20,Ftwo-year trial, also beginning on 7
OL,21,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
